{"game": "crab-champions", "language": "english", "appid": 774801, "month": "2024-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1704067200, "end_date": 1704671999, "month_true_total": 638, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-30 05:48:04 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "155517230", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095905799", "personaname": "kerrjordan2000", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095905799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1749, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 309, "last_played": 1767748418, "avatar": "ba84bde1fb490d9499b3360ba4f497d7bf7a16a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "10//10 crab on crab violence", "timestamp_created": 1704669974, "timestamp_updated": 1704669974, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155515578", "author": {"steamid": "76561198251016026", "personaname": "Jonah", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/blazer239/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2383, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 773, "last_played": 1707001172, "avatar": "6aa88761979ab80fbf2c46496714a536a532c292"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic game because of how basic, simple, but most importantly: FUN it is. The game is colorful & vibrant which makes you feel good and is easy on your eyes. The game is SMOOTH. In a game about shooting out hundreds, if not thousands of projectiles, it runs smooth and the latency in multiplayer games is perfect.\n\nFantastic value and replayability. There's a reason the game is 98% positive.", "timestamp_created": 1704668154, "timestamp_updated": 1704668199, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155515552", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050709313", "personaname": "Redrabbit", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198050709313/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1933, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 538, "last_played": 1706848627, "avatar": "a275eed2d2bd00d43497328620dd915721677b0b"}, "language": "english", "review": "In a gaming landscape often starved for genuinely engaging co-op experiences, Crab Champions emerges as a breath of fresh air. This game is a vibrant splash of color in an often monochrome world of cooperative play, setting a new standard for what we can expect from the genre. The game's palette is not just visually stunning for being bunch of crabs, but it also infuses a sense of joy and whimsy into every level, making the experience not just a game, but a celebration of fun.", "timestamp_created": 1704668135, "timestamp_updated": 1704668135, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520547926425933838", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155512997", "author": {"steamid": "76561198193502086", "personaname": "OldG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OldGuyTheGigachad/", "num_games_owned": 280, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 348, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 132, "last_played": 1725480976, "avatar": "cc9ab3a9bb40df7e097b04acf6c34ea257151c9e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is just pure, unfiltered fun. You're a crab with a gun and you got a bunch of enemies to shoot. You get loot to make yourself stronger and keep clearing islands. Really good movement, LOTS of weapons and abilities to unlock, AND you can play with your friends! Actually amazing game.", "timestamp_created": 1704665482, "timestamp_updated": 1704665482, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155511386", "author": {"steamid": "76561198826953279", "personaname": "ecoguy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198826953279/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1911, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 248, "last_played": 1787151509, "avatar": "5d3b053132348ee4627fef080da7f959a8a4a606"}, "language": "english", "review": "its really worth the money", "timestamp_created": 1704663888, "timestamp_updated": 1704663888, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155511082", "author": {"steamid": "76561199210239712", "personaname": "IIzxmII", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199210239712/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1510, "last_played": 1735459372, "avatar": "7b62b62de7cbe41e28e0d38bc0ff9a630d517150"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun\n", "timestamp_created": 1704663606, "timestamp_upd